WEBVTT

00:16.015 --> 00:18.017
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.045 --> 00:47.046
["I'm Sorry" by Ailee playing]

00:56.014 --> 00:59.184
[Jin] Uk and Bu-yeon have promised
to go their separate ways.

00:59.684 --> 01:00.602
[Heo Yeom] Mm.

01:01.186 --> 01:04.481
They said that, well,
there was no physical intimacy,

01:05.523 --> 01:07.734
it should be easy to end it.

01:07.817 --> 01:10.528
It's fortunate
they were not that close, I guess.

01:10.612 --> 01:11.738
Yeah, but…

01:12.614 --> 01:14.949
I remember them
drinking together at night.

01:15.033 --> 01:18.787
They came and told me explicitly
that their relationship was innocent

01:18.870 --> 01:21.039
and nothing serious would happen
between them at all.

01:22.415 --> 01:24.250
["I'm Sorry" continues playing]

02:22.016 --> 02:22.851
[exhales softly]

02:23.893 --> 02:24.894
Just now…

02:25.770 --> 02:27.897
I felt the energy within you.

02:28.648 --> 02:29.524
The ice stone?

02:30.150 --> 02:30.984
Yeah.

02:32.902 --> 02:33.987
It was really strong.

02:34.070 --> 02:37.657
Do you think I'll actually
be able to take it out?

02:38.324 --> 02:39.701
I've always wanted to stop…

02:41.703 --> 02:43.288
but now I don't really want to.

02:44.873 --> 02:47.208
Don't… ever think like that.

02:50.753 --> 02:51.671
Even if you do,

02:53.548 --> 02:54.883
I will never do it for you.

02:58.720 --> 02:59.804
Sorry.

02:59.888 --> 03:00.722
And…

03:02.515 --> 03:03.349
thank you.

03:17.697 --> 03:20.617
Since we've stopped, let's think about
how to deal with this situation.

03:20.700 --> 03:24.203
Why? Is the light flickering? [blows]

03:24.871 --> 03:25.705
[chuckles]

03:33.338 --> 03:37.133
If we intend on staying together,
I must take back my promise.

03:38.301 --> 03:39.636
You did make that promise.

03:39.719 --> 03:43.598
Because Lord Park was also there
when I made the promise to Lady Jin.

03:44.098 --> 03:45.934
It's a promise
between Songrim and Jinyowon.

03:46.017 --> 03:49.646
That promise saved a life,
so it was… worth it.

03:49.729 --> 03:52.857
Yes, and I'll ask Lord Park
for his understanding

03:52.941 --> 03:54.734
and get your mother
to retract the promise we made.

03:54.817 --> 03:55.652
What? Really?

03:56.319 --> 03:58.029
Are you going to threaten my mother?

03:58.112 --> 04:00.740
I'll try to convince her,
just like everybody else.

04:06.412 --> 04:07.789
"I promise to be good to her."

04:08.331 --> 04:10.375
"So please allow me
to marry your daughter, Bu-yeon."

04:11.876 --> 04:12.835
So convincing!

04:15.672 --> 04:16.798
Convince me now, then.

04:18.132 --> 04:20.426
Not now, we must take care
of the situation first.

04:20.510 --> 04:21.886
If we end up distracted,

04:21.970 --> 04:23.930
we're only gonna lose our senses.

04:24.847 --> 04:28.351
Okay. We can do it later.
Let's sort things out.

04:31.562 --> 04:33.648
You've met my mother
a few times already, right?

04:34.565 --> 04:35.400
How was she?

04:41.781 --> 04:43.116
What did you just do?

04:43.199 --> 04:45.368
Is that what you consider love, Lady Jin?

04:45.451 --> 04:47.787
Poking somebody
with needles in a dark room?

04:53.001 --> 04:53.835
[Jang Uk sighs]

04:53.918 --> 04:56.462
- Why did I mention needles?
- Needles? What?

04:56.546 --> 04:57.839
Nothing! It's nothing.

04:57.922 --> 05:00.258
If she pokes with needles,
I guess I'll just have to take it.

05:01.718 --> 05:03.845
Leaving you to do all this
may not be a good idea.

05:04.470 --> 05:06.806
For now, I think I should go back home.

05:06.889 --> 05:08.057
You're gonna leave?

05:09.309 --> 05:11.561
If I don't,
I'll only cause everyone trouble…

05:13.813 --> 05:15.565
and she'll hate you even more.

05:15.648 --> 05:18.234
Let me go home first
and make sure she's okay.

05:19.152 --> 05:20.111
Then I'll talk to her.

05:21.988 --> 05:23.197
Okay, go do that then.

05:23.906 --> 05:26.868
I'm going to talk to Lord Park
and come up with a solution.

05:36.377 --> 05:39.339
[Master Lee]
The soul of Naksu will disappear soon.

05:39.422 --> 05:42.759
Once the soul of Jin Bu-yeon,
the true owner of that body, awakens…

05:43.843 --> 05:46.637
Naksu's soul will no longer exist.

05:47.764 --> 05:49.766
[somber music playing]

06:00.777 --> 06:02.570
Do you know where is Young Master Seo?

06:02.653 --> 06:03.988
He left this morning.

06:04.530 --> 06:08.076
He said that he needed to speak
with Lord Park about something. Excuse me.

06:15.500 --> 06:16.959
He must have gone to…

06:18.086 --> 06:19.629
tell them what's written here.

06:19.712 --> 06:22.256
Will everyone soon know that Jin Bu-yeon…

06:24.467 --> 06:25.885
is really Naksu?

06:33.101 --> 06:35.311
[Bu-yeon] Jang Uk,
come home every night now.

06:35.394 --> 06:36.979
- Don't stay here.
- Mm.

06:37.063 --> 06:39.524
And tell Maidservant Kim
that I'll be back soon, okay?

06:39.607 --> 06:40.691
I will.

06:41.692 --> 06:44.529
Ah, in my room,
I left honey biscuits for you.

06:44.612 --> 06:45.446
Eat them, please.

06:45.530 --> 06:46.989
- Honey biscuits?
- [Bu-yeon] Yes.

06:47.073 --> 06:49.659
I heard they were your favorite,
so I often bought some for you.

06:49.742 --> 06:51.410
- About how many?
- A lot.

06:51.494 --> 06:53.329
You'll trip if you don't walk forward.

06:54.539 --> 06:57.500
I won't see you for a while,
so I want to look at your face.

06:59.168 --> 07:01.379
There's not a single place
in this world that I cannot go,

07:01.963 --> 07:04.257
but I don't want your mother
to hate me more than she does.

07:04.924 --> 07:05.925
Just hang on a bit, all right?

07:07.802 --> 07:09.011
See me in secret!

07:09.095 --> 07:10.763
Climb over the wall like Seo Yul did.

07:11.514 --> 07:13.349
You sound a little too excited
for something like that.

07:17.353 --> 07:20.815
By the way, how did you manage
to find my room the first time?

07:21.899 --> 07:23.693
I mean the door is hard to recognize.

07:24.444 --> 07:25.278
Door?

07:27.071 --> 07:28.281
What's this?

07:29.323 --> 07:32.076
It was already open
as if someone wanted me to come in.

07:33.327 --> 07:34.328
It was just open?

07:35.788 --> 07:38.875
It likely must have broken open
while I was fighting.

07:38.958 --> 07:40.418
That's also why
the barrier probably broke.

07:41.169 --> 07:42.211
Hmm.

07:43.671 --> 07:46.507
Then what did you think of me when we met?

07:47.091 --> 07:48.885
[inhales sharply] Hmm.

07:48.968 --> 07:51.345
That you're odd
because you were locked up,

07:51.846 --> 07:52.763
and suspicious too.

07:53.598 --> 07:55.433
[chuckles]
I liked you even from the start.

07:57.643 --> 07:59.395
I knew when I saw you.

08:00.354 --> 08:01.230
You're my husband.

08:04.692 --> 08:06.777
[soft music playing]

08:14.994 --> 08:16.245
[Jang Uk] I knew when I saw you.

08:18.372 --> 08:19.415
You are my master.

08:22.418 --> 08:23.419
[gasps softly]

08:33.429 --> 08:34.680
You felt the same way.

08:35.348 --> 08:37.016
Yes, because her blue marks…

08:38.518 --> 08:40.102
blossomed like flowers in her eyes.

08:45.024 --> 08:45.858
I don't…

08:46.651 --> 08:48.819
care you didn't recognize me when we met.

08:51.489 --> 08:52.615
As this time…

08:55.701 --> 08:56.953
I recognized you first.

09:08.214 --> 09:09.090
Let's go.

09:16.180 --> 09:19.684
You should be resting.
What was it that could not wait?

09:19.767 --> 09:21.519
There's something
I must take responsibility for.

09:21.602 --> 09:24.730
Is it something that I should also hear?

09:25.481 --> 09:26.482
What is it?

09:26.566 --> 09:28.985
Because it concerns
Jin Bu-yeon and Jang Uk as well.

09:29.068 --> 09:32.530
[sighs] Goodness, Yul, that boy!

09:33.155 --> 09:33.990
[sighs]

09:34.740 --> 09:35.783
[Yun-ok] Grandfather.

09:36.409 --> 09:39.453
Has Young Master Seo told you anything?

09:40.037 --> 09:43.666
Uh, Jin Bu-yeon,
he said something about her,

09:43.749 --> 09:46.377
saying that he wants to be responsible.

09:47.378 --> 09:48.212
[Heo Yeom sighs]

09:48.796 --> 09:51.382
The promise with Lady Jin
was made in order to save my life,

09:51.465 --> 09:53.801
so I will go to her myself
and have her annul it.

09:58.639 --> 10:00.641
Was that all Yul said?

10:01.434 --> 10:03.603
He didn't say anything else about her?

10:03.686 --> 10:04.729
Yun-ok, I…

10:05.438 --> 10:10.109
told you before, time and again
not to mind whatever Jang Uk does.

10:10.818 --> 10:12.320
Don't even be curious.

10:20.119 --> 10:21.787
Naksu wasn't mentioned?

10:24.040 --> 10:26.334
Even after he planned
to kill her at Danhyanggok?

10:28.669 --> 10:30.254
Cho-yeon left by herself?

10:30.338 --> 10:33.007
Yes, Young Master Seo asked her
to go alone.

10:35.384 --> 10:36.344
Seo Yul?

10:37.136 --> 10:39.513
Uh, what would Yul say, you think,

10:39.597 --> 10:41.891
to convince Lady Ho-gyeong
to go along with that?

10:41.974 --> 10:43.100
I don't know.

10:43.893 --> 10:47.855
He had just said that
my mother would wait if I told her

10:47.938 --> 10:51.984
that he would visit her very soon
so he can tell her what he knows.

10:52.068 --> 10:52.902
[Dang-gu] Hmm.

10:54.070 --> 10:55.655
He's not one to speak rashly,

10:56.238 --> 10:57.865
so that means it will most likely work.

10:59.283 --> 11:01.661
Should I ask him to mention
our relationship to your mother as well?

11:01.744 --> 11:05.122
We shouldn't get involved with them.
She really dislikes Jang Uk,

11:06.207 --> 11:08.793
but she does not dislike you though.

11:11.003 --> 11:11.837
I don't know

11:12.713 --> 11:14.757
why she seems to disapprove of Uk so much.

11:18.135 --> 11:20.596
Because it's painful
to see someone she hates…

11:22.890 --> 11:23.849
be happy.

11:26.310 --> 11:29.105
Yul said he'll meet Lady Jin

11:29.188 --> 11:31.857
and try to get her to annul the promise.

11:31.941 --> 11:33.401
Yul truly is amazing.

11:33.484 --> 11:35.653
He's helping out a friend
as soon as he wakes up.

11:36.987 --> 11:39.407
I told him,
"Uk has already made up his mind."

11:40.032 --> 11:42.326
"Don't get involved until you're well."

11:43.536 --> 11:44.703
So I stopped him.

11:45.955 --> 11:48.749
But why would you stop him?
All he's doing is helping out a friend.

11:49.333 --> 11:51.419
You said you're giving up though,
did you not, Uk?

11:52.211 --> 11:53.045
[sighs]

11:53.671 --> 11:55.047
[chuckles] My lord!

11:55.131 --> 11:56.674
- [exclaims]
- [Maid Kim hums]

11:57.675 --> 12:01.262
If Young Master Seo helps, are you willing
to try and convince Lady Jin, huh?

12:03.472 --> 12:07.726
I tried to marry her daughter, Bu-yeon,
without even asking her permission first,

12:07.810 --> 12:09.061
so she has every right to be mad.

12:10.020 --> 12:12.314
For now, I plan
to ease some of that hatred.

12:23.367 --> 12:24.201
I heard the news.

12:24.952 --> 12:26.454
Thank you for helping us.

12:27.788 --> 12:29.415
Well, it's my fault this happened.

12:29.498 --> 12:31.000
Still, I'm grateful.

12:31.750 --> 12:33.919
You may have realized this from last time,

12:34.003 --> 12:36.255
but before, there was no room
for me in his heart.

12:36.338 --> 12:39.592
However, now, I finally get
to stay by his side.

12:40.176 --> 12:41.260
Isn't that great?

12:46.724 --> 12:47.558
I'm not sure.

12:49.143 --> 12:50.895
You two will cause each other great pain.

12:52.313 --> 12:54.482
Why would you say that though?

12:55.566 --> 12:57.193
We are supposed to be friends, Yul.

13:00.070 --> 13:00.905
Friends?

13:02.907 --> 13:05.534
If you were aware of what I had planned
to do at Danhyanggok…

13:07.703 --> 13:09.288
you wouldn't smile and call me a friend.

13:10.915 --> 13:13.125
You look so unhappy now.

13:15.085 --> 13:16.504
Are you in pain still?

13:18.422 --> 13:19.256
Yes.

13:19.340 --> 13:20.466
I'm still hurt.

13:22.384 --> 13:24.595
It must have been
because of the terrible dream.

13:25.513 --> 13:26.764
Did you have a bad dream?

13:28.182 --> 13:30.434
I dreamt of disappearing
together with someone…

13:32.520 --> 13:34.271
who I've cherished for a very long time.

13:38.442 --> 13:40.861
But when I woke up
from the dream, it turns out that…

13:42.613 --> 13:44.573
I'll remain
while that person will disappear.

13:48.202 --> 13:50.037
I feel angry and also disheartened.

13:51.580 --> 13:53.791
But mostly,
my heart aches for them so much.

13:56.210 --> 13:57.836
I'm filled with much sadness.

14:02.174 --> 14:05.261
[Seo Yul] All of my memories
of Danhyanggok are wonderful.

14:06.262 --> 14:07.137
[gasps softly]

14:09.640 --> 14:10.641
Yul, have…

14:12.810 --> 14:15.229
have you and I met before at Danhyanggok?

14:19.400 --> 14:21.652
You said if you went to Danhyanggok,
you'd find yourself.

14:22.987 --> 14:25.739
Go and find out who you really are.

14:25.823 --> 14:28.158
Then you'll realize
what I'd planned to do there…

14:29.410 --> 14:31.537
and why you and Uk will
only end up causing…

14:33.747 --> 14:34.707
each other pain.

14:37.585 --> 14:38.794
I don't want to know.

14:39.920 --> 14:41.714
I won't go there if that's the case.

14:43.299 --> 14:45.092
If the real me can't be with Jang Uk…

14:46.844 --> 14:48.012
I don't want to know.

14:51.599 --> 14:52.975
You'll eventually discover…

14:57.021 --> 14:58.063
who you are anyway.

14:58.147 --> 14:59.148
You asked me…

15:00.649 --> 15:02.735
to feign total ignorance
when you could have died, Yul.

15:04.570 --> 15:06.030
I ask the same of you now.

15:06.113 --> 15:07.323
Please forget about it.

15:19.919 --> 15:21.503
Your foolish friend will give you time.

15:23.005 --> 15:24.131
But if you ever need me at all…

15:25.925 --> 15:27.092
please come find me.

15:46.278 --> 15:47.279
[sighs]

15:58.582 --> 15:59.458
Young Lady.

16:01.335 --> 16:02.336
I heard the news.

16:03.128 --> 16:04.338
I'm very happy for you.

16:05.089 --> 16:06.757
Right, thanks.

16:07.341 --> 16:08.968
Young Master Jang even asked

16:09.051 --> 16:12.054
Lord Park to convince your mother
to change her mind.

16:12.638 --> 16:13.597
Is that so?

16:13.681 --> 16:16.600
I knew things would work out.
[chuckles]

16:17.101 --> 16:20.437
I'm very glad that
you are the one beside him.

16:21.021 --> 16:21.981
Do you think that…

16:23.691 --> 16:26.318
it will be okay to stay by Uk?

16:26.402 --> 16:27.611
Of course.

16:28.112 --> 16:31.824
Now all that's left is to prepare
for the wedding we've been waiting for.

16:32.533 --> 16:33.492
Hmm.

16:33.575 --> 16:36.620
Oh, Young Master Jang is meeting
someone from the palace right now.

16:36.704 --> 16:38.414
Let us head home first.

16:39.289 --> 16:40.582
- Let's.
- Come.

16:42.209 --> 16:43.919
[Maid Kim chuckles]

16:46.088 --> 16:48.590
Today, His Royal Majesty will be
summoning you.

16:49.174 --> 16:51.051
But the Crown Prince wishes
to see you first.

16:54.513 --> 16:56.432
Inside this chest is an item
that belongs to him.

16:56.515 --> 16:59.727
If you possess the same item, he wants you
to bring it with you when you see him.

17:01.353 --> 17:04.064
You must open it
when absolutely no one is around you.

17:09.695 --> 17:10.529
[sighs]

17:14.616 --> 17:16.660
[tense music playing]

17:17.661 --> 17:22.082
This is the Gold Plaque that the King left
for his son who will succeed him.

17:22.166 --> 17:23.500
What's he playing at?

17:32.217 --> 17:33.802
[Go Won] Is that the King's Star I see?

17:33.886 --> 17:37.598
He's a dangerous star
who's ready to take your place anytime.

17:40.392 --> 17:41.310
[Eunuch Oh] Royal Highness.

17:42.186 --> 17:43.771
I visited Uk and invited him.

17:44.688 --> 17:45.522
Good.

17:47.816 --> 17:49.735
[Eunuch Oh] As for the turtle,
I couldn't find it anywhere.

17:50.360 --> 17:51.487
I suppose he's gone now.

17:52.112 --> 17:52.946
[sighs]

17:54.740 --> 17:57.868
Lord Dang-gu gave orders
to collect her body and hold a funeral,

17:57.951 --> 18:01.789
but this young man kicked up a fuss,
insisting that you come see her.

18:01.872 --> 18:03.123
Um…

18:03.207 --> 18:05.334
she wanted to make sure
that you were doing all right.

18:07.836 --> 18:09.379
I am sure she is happy now.

18:14.843 --> 18:16.470
- What is that?
- Uh…

18:17.638 --> 18:20.891
it was something she cherished dearly.

18:21.683 --> 18:24.978
I don't know why she treasured
an umbrella she never used when it rained.

18:28.690 --> 18:29.566
[sighs]

18:39.159 --> 18:41.036
Does she have any family
who can hold a funeral?

18:41.120 --> 18:43.080
Uh… no.

18:44.164 --> 18:46.208
She said the world she knew
was filthy and dirty.

18:46.291 --> 18:48.961
[Yong-pil] You were the only clean
and bright thing in it.

18:51.588 --> 18:54.133
Please find a place
that's warm and full of sunlight for her.

18:55.843 --> 18:57.344
I will set up a funeral in her honor.

18:58.637 --> 18:59.638
Yes.

19:10.065 --> 19:12.776
[Bu-yeon] I thought I was seeing
all those memories because of this.

19:13.569 --> 19:14.862
But was I wrong?

19:15.612 --> 19:16.446
[sighs]

19:16.530 --> 19:17.447
What could they be?

19:18.198 --> 19:19.533
[Seo Yul]
Then you'll realize why you and Uk

19:19.616 --> 19:21.243
will only end up causing each other pain.

19:23.328 --> 19:25.372
Will I find out if I go to Danhyanggok?

19:28.167 --> 19:31.044
Young Lady.
Young Master Jang just got here.

19:38.135 --> 19:38.969
Jang Uk.

19:40.762 --> 19:41.763
Hey.

19:43.223 --> 19:45.434
I've got to go to the palace
right now for an urgent matter.

19:45.517 --> 19:46.393
I won't take too much time.

19:47.144 --> 19:47.978
Hmm.

19:52.357 --> 19:53.567
I need to get changed now.

19:54.359 --> 19:55.402
Are you gonna keep staring?

19:58.864 --> 20:00.657
No, we can't.
We keep the light on for now.

20:05.037 --> 20:08.874
Is that scar from being stabbed with that?

20:13.670 --> 20:14.504
Yes.

20:17.674 --> 20:18.508
So what…

20:20.052 --> 20:21.595
you were dying to know was how…

20:23.847 --> 20:25.015
she felt in that moment?

20:27.142 --> 20:30.938
Everyone said that she did this
to avenge her family.

20:32.189 --> 20:34.524
But still, I just couldn't know

20:35.567 --> 20:36.568
if she truly…

20:37.694 --> 20:38.946
went easy on me or not.

20:40.697 --> 20:41.782
Such a sad…

20:43.825 --> 20:44.993
and terrible scar.

20:52.292 --> 20:54.378
I don't wish to see
the memory of that moment.

20:56.421 --> 20:57.256
Wait.

20:58.048 --> 20:59.675
So you've still been seeing
those memories?

21:00.259 --> 21:03.220
I think I don't want to see
someone else's memories.

21:03.303 --> 21:05.347
They are hers, not mine.

21:05.430 --> 21:07.307
You said you'd remember who you were

21:07.891 --> 21:09.559
if you saw that tree in Danhyanggok.

21:09.643 --> 21:11.019
- Should we go soon?
- I can't.

21:11.937 --> 21:13.522
I think I was confused about that.

21:14.022 --> 21:14.940
We shouldn't go.

21:16.817 --> 21:18.610
You should finish
getting changed and go now.

21:21.697 --> 21:23.615
Okay. Wait for me here.

21:25.409 --> 21:28.161
Okay, I'll be waiting.

21:28.245 --> 21:30.038
[inhale deeply]
Hmm…

21:30.664 --> 21:31.581
what is it?

21:32.082 --> 21:34.584
I can tell you were feeling
elated earlier for sure…

21:35.252 --> 21:36.211
[clicks tongue, inhales deeply]

21:36.295 --> 21:37.629
…but now you seem a little bit down.

21:39.798 --> 21:42.134
It's just hard for me to believe
that you told me to wait.

21:42.718 --> 21:45.929
Because you always tell me to leave
or never come home at all.

21:46.930 --> 21:47.848
You remember?

21:55.856 --> 21:57.733
Don't go anywhere and wait here, okay?

22:00.110 --> 22:00.944
Uh-huh.

22:02.529 --> 22:05.532
I will quickly be by your side again.

22:17.711 --> 22:18.962
And I promise you…

22:21.131 --> 22:22.758
I'll always be by yours.

22:34.019 --> 22:36.021
You were looking for Young Master Seo.
Did you see him?

22:36.104 --> 22:37.939
- I just saw him leave.
- It's fine.

22:39.107 --> 22:40.275
I'll just do it.

22:43.612 --> 22:45.614
[tense music playing]

22:46.907 --> 22:48.700
- Here it is.
- What is that for?

22:50.702 --> 22:52.537
It's used on corpses.

22:53.163 --> 22:54.623
It shows hidden scars.

22:54.706 --> 22:58.502
The blue mark of a soul shifter's scar.
If you apply it, it'll show.

22:59.294 --> 23:00.962
So how do you plan to use it?

23:04.257 --> 23:06.009
She said she didn't want to know.

23:09.721 --> 23:11.223
So I plan to reveal it.

23:14.601 --> 23:16.436
[Ho-gyeong] You survived thanks to me.

23:16.520 --> 23:18.730
Now you come over here
to threaten me with her secret?

23:18.814 --> 23:21.441
If it sounded like a threat,
then so be it.

23:22.442 --> 23:24.903
And don't try to keep Naksu
locked up in Jinyowon anymore.

23:24.986 --> 23:27.697
Then you're saying
I should let her stay with Jang Uk?

23:27.781 --> 23:30.826
If that's what she wants to do,
I'm going to help her do that.

23:30.909 --> 23:32.077
Then that leaves me…

23:33.286 --> 23:36.123
no reason to keep Naksu alive anymore.

23:36.206 --> 23:37.749
You must stop thinking like that.

23:39.126 --> 23:40.460
That's why your daughter, Jin Bu-yeon,

23:41.670 --> 23:43.130
will be able to return.

23:43.713 --> 23:44.548
What?

23:46.633 --> 23:48.135
My daughter, Bu-yeon, will return?

23:49.427 --> 23:50.470
What do you mean?

23:50.554 --> 23:52.389
Naksu's soul will soon disappear,

23:53.056 --> 23:55.267
and that body will solely
belong to Jin Bu-yeon.

23:56.560 --> 23:58.019
That is what Master Lee told me.

23:58.603 --> 24:01.940
He told me her soul was gone forever.

24:02.649 --> 24:05.902
So then, has he been deceiving me?

24:05.986 --> 24:07.320
Please ask him yourself.

24:09.489 --> 24:10.407
Just let her…

24:11.575 --> 24:12.868
stay where she wishes

24:13.869 --> 24:15.453
with the person she wishes to be with…

24:17.497 --> 24:18.582
even if it's brief.

24:20.834 --> 24:22.043
This is obviously a threat…

24:25.213 --> 24:26.464
but it is a plea as well.

24:28.049 --> 24:30.051
[suspenseful music playing]

24:51.198 --> 24:52.240
[Go Won] Why are you empty-handed?

24:52.324 --> 24:53.783
Why didn't you bring what I asked?

24:54.784 --> 24:55.702
Do you not have the same?

24:55.785 --> 24:58.121
I didn't bring it
as it did not seem necessary.

24:58.205 --> 24:59.539
If you didn't bring it,

25:00.624 --> 25:02.542
then I will assume
you at least have it, right?

25:02.626 --> 25:05.045
The fact that you know
I possess it means you also

25:05.128 --> 25:08.089
know how it was that I came to be
in this world, Your Royal Highness.

25:09.591 --> 25:10.508
[sighs]

25:13.678 --> 25:15.805
If you do not intend
to fight me over the Gold Plaque,

25:16.389 --> 25:18.058
go up north, Jang Uk.

25:19.768 --> 25:22.020
I will hide behind Jin Mu
just like you said,

25:22.938 --> 25:24.397
and you will have to go far away.

25:24.981 --> 25:25.857
[Jang Uk sighs]

25:31.988 --> 25:35.283
I, Jang Uk of the Jang family, will go
to the North Fortress as commanded.

25:35.367 --> 25:37.369
[Sun] Thank you for honoring my command.

25:37.452 --> 25:40.914
Waste no time
and go get ready to leave soon, all right?

25:46.378 --> 25:49.756
[Jin Mu] I had planned to threaten
Park Jin of Songrim to pressure Jang Uk.

25:49.839 --> 25:52.592
But I had no idea that
you would reveal the Gold Plaque

25:52.676 --> 25:54.636
in order to compel him to bend.

25:57.889 --> 26:00.267
I realized something
when I was going up against him.

26:00.850 --> 26:03.311
Jang Uk does not fight in order to gain,

26:04.271 --> 26:06.022
but rather he'd fight so he can protect.

26:06.940 --> 26:08.900
Therefore, if I challenged him
over the plaque…

26:10.902 --> 26:14.406
instead of fighting against me,
he would back down to protect.

26:14.489 --> 26:16.157
[chuckles]

26:16.992 --> 26:19.202
Park Jin of Songrim
also couldn't do anything

26:19.828 --> 26:21.329
to protect Jang Uk at all.

26:23.581 --> 26:26.459
They're faint-hearted
who fail to do what is necessary,

26:27.168 --> 26:28.753
restrained by a sense of justice.

26:29.671 --> 26:31.172
[both chuckle]

26:34.384 --> 26:35.468
I see now.

26:39.014 --> 26:39.848
Gwanju.

26:39.931 --> 26:43.268
Ever since a few days ago,
I can't seem to find my turtle anywhere.

26:46.438 --> 26:49.774
It's a weak animal
that doesn't suit you, Royal Highness.

26:50.525 --> 26:53.486
Don't allow yourself
to cling to such things.

26:55.030 --> 26:56.323
Did you try to get rid of it…

26:57.782 --> 26:59.409
so I could shed my weakness?

27:01.828 --> 27:03.204
Do you wish to find it again?

27:08.543 --> 27:09.377
I don't.

27:09.461 --> 27:12.881
I just think it's a shame
because I was told it had good energy.

27:12.964 --> 27:16.259
If it's an animal with good energy
you seek, there's a peacock in the garden.

27:16.343 --> 27:20.305
They're animals that merely exist
for our own amusement.

27:21.014 --> 27:22.766
[chuckles softly]
Hmm.

27:25.226 --> 27:26.102
I guess you're right.

27:33.860 --> 27:35.862
[intense music playing]

27:40.825 --> 27:43.495
So you have agreed
to go to North Fortress?

27:43.578 --> 27:46.456
Yes, I have decided to go, my lord.

27:47.374 --> 27:49.209
I'm actually very concerned

27:49.292 --> 27:52.003
that they may be plotting
to do something while you are far away.

27:52.087 --> 27:54.255
The Crown Prince showed me
his Gold Plaque and asked

27:55.215 --> 27:56.883
if I'd be willing
to start a fight for him.

27:58.176 --> 28:00.804
If I decide to participate in this fight,

28:01.971 --> 28:05.225
would you also be willing to
stand behind me as you did last time?

28:05.308 --> 28:07.685
What is it
you wish to protect in this fight?

28:09.396 --> 28:11.314
And what is it you're aiming to fight for?

28:13.024 --> 28:15.235
Are you making this decision
after giving it much thought?

28:15.819 --> 28:18.321
Yes, I have taken precise aim

28:19.114 --> 28:21.157
and have ultimately decided
to accept this fight

28:22.283 --> 28:23.576
to protect what I must.

28:29.374 --> 28:30.250
What brings you here?

28:30.750 --> 28:32.293
Young Lady Heo has asked to see you now.

28:33.461 --> 28:34.796
Is she inviting me to Sejukwon?

28:34.879 --> 28:36.005
I don't know.

28:36.089 --> 28:38.842
She wants you to meet her
where Young Master Jang frequently visits.

28:43.471 --> 28:45.640
We received a message from Seoho Fortress.

28:45.724 --> 28:47.934
Your father is very worried about you.

28:49.853 --> 28:51.438
I'll make sure
to write him a letter myself.

28:51.521 --> 28:54.858
Ah. We should have asked
Lord Park to take the letter

28:55.442 --> 28:57.902
that was in your belongings
he got from your home.

28:58.903 --> 29:01.072
Did you see the letter
that was within my belongings?

29:01.156 --> 29:04.075
Yes, Young Lady Heo had brought
the letter to me.

29:10.457 --> 29:11.583
Where's Young Lady Yun-ok?

29:15.044 --> 29:16.796
Why did you ask me to meet you here?

29:19.007 --> 29:19.924
I heard that

29:20.717 --> 29:23.219
Young Master Jang built this
as a graveyard

29:23.303 --> 29:24.846
since he started killing soul shifters.

29:25.722 --> 29:29.601
There should be a grave here
for Naksu, the one who killed him.

29:32.937 --> 29:34.230
It's that one?

29:35.982 --> 29:38.485
You said you don't remember
who you are, right?

29:39.068 --> 29:40.153
Are you not curious at all?

29:40.236 --> 29:41.613
What concern is it to you, Yun-ok?

29:41.696 --> 29:42.864
I've become curious.

29:45.074 --> 29:47.118
So I came to confirm my theory.

29:49.871 --> 29:50.830
What is that?

29:52.123 --> 29:53.291
No need to worry.

29:53.374 --> 29:55.251
I would never harm anyone.

29:55.335 --> 29:57.754
I only try to ascertain things

29:58.254 --> 29:59.422
that are still unknown.

30:01.883 --> 30:03.635
[ominous music playing]

30:03.718 --> 30:04.636
[Bu-yeon gasps]

30:07.722 --> 30:09.974
- The blue mark should be here.
- What are you doing?

30:15.146 --> 30:16.022
[groans]

30:23.988 --> 30:25.990
- Young Master.
- What do you think you're doing?

30:27.700 --> 30:28.535
Are you okay, Bu-yeon?

30:28.618 --> 30:29.619
Yeah, I'm all right.

30:30.578 --> 30:31.955
Why did you have to splash that on me?

30:32.038 --> 30:34.082
- Because you're a soul shift--
- Hey, enough.

30:35.500 --> 30:37.669
If you're doing this
because of my letter, just stop it.

30:38.253 --> 30:39.671
I'll explain everything.

30:44.092 --> 30:45.760
You should hurry up and find some water,

30:45.844 --> 30:47.595
and wash off that medicine
that got on you.

30:47.679 --> 30:48.596
Okay then.

30:51.808 --> 30:52.767
[sighs]

30:57.230 --> 30:58.940
I assume you read my letter.

30:59.983 --> 31:00.817
Yeah.

31:00.900 --> 31:03.194
If everything in that letter is true,

31:03.278 --> 31:05.113
why are you letting her be then?

31:05.738 --> 31:07.115
She's Naksu, isn't she?

31:13.830 --> 31:14.789
[groans softly]

31:19.878 --> 31:21.838
[dramatic music playing]

31:24.549 --> 31:26.426
[Jang Uk] Yes, because her blue marks

31:27.260 --> 31:28.970
blossomed like flowers in her eyes.

31:37.645 --> 31:38.605
[gasps]

31:41.941 --> 31:42.859
Is that…

31:45.862 --> 31:46.779
really me?

31:48.448 --> 31:52.285
That woman is someone who has hurt
Young Master Jang very deeply.

31:52.368 --> 31:55.371
I couldn't bear to see him
get hurt again by her.

31:55.455 --> 31:56.706
She should leave.

31:57.749 --> 31:58.917
She should know who she is.

32:02.378 --> 32:03.796
Even if you don't let her know…

32:05.882 --> 32:07.216
that soul will soon disappear.

32:11.137 --> 32:12.180
I just wanted…

32:15.183 --> 32:17.101
her to stay like this a bit longer.

32:20.229 --> 32:22.231
[somber music playing]

32:42.001 --> 32:43.378
[Jang Uk] My crazy master…

32:46.047 --> 32:47.799
I guess you've poisoned me again.

33:07.151 --> 33:09.153
[soft music playing]

33:20.748 --> 33:22.792
[thrilling music playing]

33:28.631 --> 33:29.674
So it's over there.

33:33.594 --> 33:35.054
I've been in this place before.

33:35.638 --> 33:36.681
[Jang Uk] Do you want to go up?

33:38.933 --> 33:39.767
All right.

33:40.393 --> 33:43.563
I promise I will take you
all the way to the top.

33:46.315 --> 33:47.942
I knew the moment I saw you.

33:48.026 --> 33:49.235
My crazy master.

33:51.195 --> 33:53.281
[Mu-deok] I have no need
for a pupil who won't improve.

33:53.364 --> 33:55.491
If you're not going to do anything,
you should just die.

33:56.242 --> 33:57.827
[Jang Uk] Master! Master!

33:58.453 --> 33:59.579
You are my master.

34:01.664 --> 34:03.249
Master, I finally did it.

34:03.875 --> 34:04.959
[Mu-deok] Bird's eggs.

34:05.043 --> 34:06.169
[Jang Uk] I also missed you.

34:08.129 --> 34:09.714
[Mu-deok] Jang Uk, I like you a lot.

34:10.506 --> 34:11.424
[Jang Uk] Just one.

34:12.216 --> 34:15.511
You are the only one. I will wear it
on my hand for the rest of my life.

34:19.098 --> 34:20.683
[Bu-yeon] They were all my memories.

34:25.688 --> 34:27.398
I was the owner of this blue jade.

34:28.399 --> 34:29.275
[sobs]

34:29.358 --> 34:31.027
And I was his master…

34:33.446 --> 34:34.322
Naksu.

34:38.659 --> 34:39.702
[sobs]

34:42.121 --> 34:44.123
[somber music playing]

35:01.349 --> 35:03.518
You must be Jin Bu-yeon,
the owner of this body.

35:04.143 --> 35:06.062
I see you have finally realized

35:06.604 --> 35:08.022
who you actually are now.

35:09.065 --> 35:10.108
What a shame!

35:10.191 --> 35:12.777
If only you'd found out
when my powers fully returned,

35:13.528 --> 35:16.447
you'd been able to leave
without any sadness at all.

35:18.449 --> 35:21.744
[young Bu-yeon] Thanks to you, my body has
become whole without running wild.

35:22.620 --> 35:24.622
I've gained most of my powers as well.

35:25.581 --> 35:27.375
You'll have to leave this body…

35:28.793 --> 35:29.961
for it's not yours.

35:33.214 --> 35:34.090
[gasps]

35:39.637 --> 35:41.514
[Jang Uk]
Someone from Sejukwon came to see her?

35:41.597 --> 35:42.515
[Mr. Lee] Yes.

35:42.598 --> 35:44.809
Then she was at Sejukwon?

35:44.892 --> 35:48.437
Um, no, I offered to take her there
if that was where she was going.

35:48.521 --> 35:49.981
But she went somewhere else instead.

35:51.357 --> 35:52.525
All right, thank you.

35:55.570 --> 35:57.989
[breathes deeply]

36:00.199 --> 36:02.160
Where did she go? She said she'd wait.

36:11.544 --> 36:12.503
It's gone.

36:14.964 --> 36:17.008
My memories are confused because of it.

36:17.592 --> 36:20.469
If I see it, I'm sure
it will help me figure things out.

36:20.553 --> 36:22.180
So did she really go there?

36:23.472 --> 36:24.682
But why though?

36:33.316 --> 36:35.526
[Ju-wol] This is where
they first met each other.

36:36.235 --> 36:38.237
And this is where he proposed to her.

36:47.622 --> 36:48.664
[sobs]

36:48.748 --> 36:50.750
[somber music playing]

36:59.217 --> 37:00.301
[sighs]

37:04.722 --> 37:06.724
[Ju-wol clears throat]
Um…

37:07.225 --> 37:09.518
is, uh, Young Lady doing okay?

37:12.980 --> 37:15.900
Please send someone to Uk's house
and tell them that Bu-yeon is here.

37:28.537 --> 37:30.539
[somber music continues playing]

37:39.382 --> 37:40.216
Okay, there you are.

37:43.469 --> 37:44.845
How come you didn't wait for me?

37:44.929 --> 37:47.473
I almost went to Danhyanggok,
thinking you might have gone by yourself.

37:49.642 --> 37:50.643
Actually, I did go there.

37:53.271 --> 37:54.188
And I…

37:57.275 --> 37:58.818
I discovered who I really am.

38:16.335 --> 38:18.546
You mean you somehow
remembered your lost memories?

38:20.548 --> 38:21.382
Correct.

38:27.972 --> 38:30.474
Then what were you doing here
instead of coming back home?

38:31.100 --> 38:32.810
I was waiting
and I had to come looking for you.

38:33.769 --> 38:35.730
I said I'd wait. I feel bad now.

38:38.691 --> 38:39.608
But now…

38:40.651 --> 38:41.986
I can't wait for you.

38:43.779 --> 38:45.823
I remembered something very important.

38:48.409 --> 38:49.660
I'll tell you this much.

38:50.745 --> 38:53.539
No matter what kind of person you were
and all the memories you lost,

38:54.832 --> 38:55.833
it doesn't matter anymore.

38:59.253 --> 39:00.421
I'm telling you that…

39:01.630 --> 39:03.841
- I'm all right with it, Bu-yeon.
- Well, I'm not all right with it.

39:07.345 --> 39:08.846
Because the memories I regained…

39:13.809 --> 39:15.519
were of someone I liked very much.

39:17.813 --> 39:18.773
You always manage…

39:20.858 --> 39:23.444
to catch me completely off guard
by some of the things you say.

39:25.196 --> 39:26.614
- So then?
- But…

39:29.325 --> 39:31.535
he can't recognize me,
even when I'm in front of him.

39:33.579 --> 39:34.413
Really?

39:38.250 --> 39:40.711
Then you should have told him
so he can recognize you.

39:42.963 --> 39:43.839
I cannot do that.

39:45.758 --> 39:48.219
Because I've hurt
this person far too much that I…

39:50.554 --> 39:51.722
just can't talk to him…

39:54.266 --> 39:55.434
or even go near him.

39:59.021 --> 40:00.981
I feel too guilty
to stay by your side like this.

40:01.482 --> 40:02.566
I shall go to Jinyowon.

40:03.442 --> 40:04.693
No, wait. Wait!

40:07.363 --> 40:08.656
You're just gonna leave like this?

40:08.739 --> 40:10.032
You said you'd wait!

40:10.908 --> 40:13.119
And now you're gonna leave
just because you remembered someone?

40:14.286 --> 40:15.788
Am I supposed to say "Oh, right,"

40:16.497 --> 40:17.957
and wish you a happy future
with that person?

40:19.458 --> 40:20.376
I mean, come on!

40:21.627 --> 40:23.546
Don't go to him, he can't recognize you.

40:28.759 --> 40:29.677
But I really…

40:33.305 --> 40:34.598
did like him very much.

40:40.980 --> 40:42.982
I actually liked him
more than he liked me.

40:45.860 --> 40:47.862
But I never once
got the chance to tell him that.

40:50.448 --> 40:52.450
["Aching" by Kassy playing]

40:58.122 --> 40:59.165
[sobs]

41:04.420 --> 41:05.254
Jang Uk.

41:08.299 --> 41:09.341
You can turn the light on.

41:10.217 --> 41:13.596
And let me go as you promised
you would if I said I would leave.

41:28.486 --> 41:29.528
I'm sorry.

41:36.285 --> 41:38.287
["Aching" continues playing]

41:49.757 --> 41:50.591
Mother.

41:50.674 --> 41:52.301
Bu-yeon has just come home.

41:52.384 --> 41:54.803
[gasps] Bu-yeon's here?

42:17.618 --> 42:18.452
Mother.

42:19.828 --> 42:20.871
I've returned home…

42:22.414 --> 42:23.666
just as I promised.

42:31.382 --> 42:33.300
Is it true
Young Lady Jin went back to Jinyowon?

42:33.968 --> 42:36.053
Why? She said she was going to stay.

42:36.887 --> 42:38.430
I heard Lady Jin isn't well.

42:38.931 --> 42:40.474
Did she leave because she's worried?

42:41.642 --> 42:42.893
She wants to stay there for now.

42:42.977 --> 42:44.103
Do not worry.

42:44.186 --> 42:45.020
[Maid Kim] Hmm.

42:47.022 --> 42:49.900
Hmm, is Lady Jin's condition that bad?

42:50.568 --> 42:51.986
[Cho-yeon] Your room is ready for you.

42:52.069 --> 42:53.737
Why do you want to stay here?

42:54.738 --> 42:56.282
This place is more familiar.

42:57.741 --> 42:59.243
And I don't want to see anyone.

43:00.578 --> 43:01.787
Don't worry for me.

43:15.634 --> 43:18.095
I heard that you'll be heading north soon.

43:18.721 --> 43:19.555
Yeah.

43:20.514 --> 43:23.684
I've already discussed the matter
with Lord Park as well, so do not worry.

43:24.435 --> 43:25.269
Yeah.

43:26.770 --> 43:28.480
Did you tell Young Lady Jin about it?

43:28.564 --> 43:29.732
No, not yet.

43:30.858 --> 43:32.026
I know I should have told her…

43:34.486 --> 43:35.863
but I just didn't get a chance to.

43:40.993 --> 43:42.161
[sighs]

43:43.412 --> 43:45.831
[somber music playing]

43:51.003 --> 43:52.129
[Jang Uk] I knew when I saw you.

43:54.381 --> 43:55.382
You are my master.

44:07.519 --> 44:08.729
[sobs]

44:13.400 --> 44:14.693
[Bu-yeon] I knew when I saw you.

44:15.861 --> 44:16.737
You're my husband.

44:18.530 --> 44:19.448
[sighs]

44:20.991 --> 44:22.993
[suspenseful music playing]

44:26.080 --> 44:30.000
I appoint Jang Uk of the Jang family
as the general of North Fortress.

44:36.924 --> 44:40.344
Just as Seo Gyeong retreated
to Seoho Fortress

44:40.427 --> 44:42.304
to prevent himself from being a threat,

44:42.388 --> 44:44.098
thus achieving unity.

44:44.181 --> 44:46.058
Jang Uk's retreat to North Fortress

44:46.141 --> 44:48.936
shall also maintain
the peace and stability.

44:50.104 --> 44:53.899
[Go Won] Daeho Fortress will be protected
by me and Cheonbugwan.

44:53.982 --> 44:56.652
We'll soon begin preparations
for the rite of the lake.

44:56.735 --> 44:59.446
So Jang Uk, travel up north
and wait for the black clouds

44:59.530 --> 45:01.073
that will pour down energy on the world.

45:02.741 --> 45:03.617
Yes.

45:03.700 --> 45:05.285
I heard that you were married.

45:06.286 --> 45:07.454
Will your wife go with you?

45:09.581 --> 45:12.626
It's too far away from here,
so she won't be coming.

45:12.709 --> 45:13.627
[clicks tongue]

45:14.503 --> 45:16.213
Your new bride will be
lonely here without you.

45:17.047 --> 45:19.716
[Sun] In any case,
take care on your journey.

45:20.843 --> 45:21.677
Yes.

45:25.764 --> 45:26.598
[sighs]

45:32.271 --> 45:34.231
Naksu's soul will soon disappear,

45:34.314 --> 45:36.483
and that body will solely
belong to Jin Bu-yeon.

45:38.527 --> 45:40.112
That is what Master Lee told me.

45:41.572 --> 45:43.115
[Ho-gyeong] Is her soul really gone

45:43.699 --> 45:45.033
just like he said it would be?

45:53.625 --> 45:54.460
It's not.

45:56.295 --> 45:58.797
If that were true,
she'd return as Bu-yeon.

45:59.840 --> 46:03.051
But that's not yet… my daughter, Bu-yeon.

46:13.896 --> 46:15.189
If he goes to the north…

46:18.192 --> 46:19.359
will I ever see him?

46:21.195 --> 46:23.822
So should I call for her?

46:23.906 --> 46:25.991
- [jade clicks]
- [sighs]

46:27.201 --> 46:30.412
[Bu-yeon] The memories I regained
were of someone I liked very much.

46:31.413 --> 46:32.456
I mean, could it be?

46:33.332 --> 46:34.166
Who was it though?

46:34.249 --> 46:36.210
Three years have passed since then.

46:38.212 --> 46:40.088
How could she still be heartbroken?

46:40.172 --> 46:42.174
[Bu-yeon] I actually liked him
more than he liked me.

46:43.217 --> 46:44.843
I guess, yeah, that makes sense, yeah.

46:45.677 --> 46:47.221
It could certainly be a possibility.

46:49.014 --> 46:51.683
But still, how could she toss me aside

46:51.767 --> 46:54.269
after telling me even a brazier
can be missed in the summer?

46:57.940 --> 46:59.942
She's so cold.
[sighs]

47:05.489 --> 47:06.740
[Bu-yeon] You can turn the light on.

47:07.950 --> 47:09.785
You totally deceived me, you know that?

47:09.868 --> 47:10.911
Why would you do this?

47:11.787 --> 47:14.164
You should have remembered
before I fell for you.

47:14.248 --> 47:16.083
How am I supposed
to turn the light back on now?

47:17.960 --> 47:18.961
Even after hearing that…

47:20.796 --> 47:22.256
I still miss her like crazy.

47:24.841 --> 47:27.094
I've informed Young Lady Jin
of your arrival.

47:30.138 --> 47:31.056
[sighs]

47:33.850 --> 47:35.686
[somber music playing]

47:57.165 --> 48:00.752
Bu-yeon knows
that you're leaving first thing tomorrow.

48:02.504 --> 48:04.548
She told me to tell you
to have a safe trip.

48:04.631 --> 48:05.632
Please tell her that…

48:06.758 --> 48:08.385
I'll come to see her as soon as I return.

48:26.194 --> 48:27.070
Why is…

48:28.697 --> 48:29.990
Jang Uk clinging to her?

48:31.325 --> 48:32.784
And she's rejecting him?

48:50.802 --> 48:51.887
[Jang Uk] You said

48:52.638 --> 48:53.639
"come in secret."

48:56.183 --> 48:57.643
I took your advice.

48:58.226 --> 49:00.562
I should have destroyed this place
the last time I came here.

49:01.772 --> 49:03.023
Why are you back here?

49:03.607 --> 49:05.067
Because I prefer to stay here.

49:07.361 --> 49:09.404
It's a good place to think by myself.

49:10.280 --> 49:11.323
I thought you were going to leave.

49:12.366 --> 49:13.367
Why are you here?

49:13.450 --> 49:14.910
Because you watched me leave.

49:16.078 --> 49:17.287
I came to show you my face.

49:19.665 --> 49:21.083
I heard you're traveling far.

49:22.125 --> 49:23.210
Goodbye.

49:24.044 --> 49:24.878
"Goodbye"?

49:25.545 --> 49:27.964
I usually have no problem
just leaving people like this.

49:29.299 --> 49:31.426
But I was so dumbfounded
that I had to come ask.

49:31.510 --> 49:32.552
Fine.

49:33.637 --> 49:36.473
You might feel guilty
or even heartbroken after forgetting him.

49:36.556 --> 49:37.391
But then…

49:38.600 --> 49:40.268
why'd you fall for me at first sight?

49:40.852 --> 49:42.437
I wanted to ask if he and I look similar,

49:42.521 --> 49:44.398
but asking that also feels too rude.

49:44.481 --> 49:45.440
Do not ask.

49:46.900 --> 49:48.360
I cannot tell you anything, Jang Uk.

49:48.443 --> 49:49.361
Do we look alike?

49:50.195 --> 49:53.073
Did you fall for me at first sight
because I looked just like that guy?

49:53.156 --> 49:54.366
Then let's say it's so.

49:54.449 --> 49:55.992
I liked you because you looked like him,

49:56.576 --> 49:57.994
you liked me because you were confused.

50:01.623 --> 50:02.874
Let's leave it at that and move on.

50:02.958 --> 50:04.751
But how can I do that? How?

50:05.711 --> 50:07.629
I thought about it over and over again.

50:07.713 --> 50:11.633
The reason I'm staying is not
because I'm confused or even crazy.

50:12.801 --> 50:13.635
It's just…

50:17.305 --> 50:19.391
It's because I liked you so much,
I lost my mind.

50:25.063 --> 50:25.981
You're the one…

50:27.441 --> 50:29.651
who helped me face
the memories that I couldn't before.

50:30.652 --> 50:32.863
You held my hand
when I thought no one would ever again.

50:32.946 --> 50:34.614
You helped me sleep when I could not.

50:34.698 --> 50:35.615
That's why…

50:37.242 --> 50:38.869
I won't be able to stop anymore.

50:40.579 --> 50:42.998
So I'll be the brazier
on a summer day you don't miss.

50:46.293 --> 50:48.086
This time, I'm gonna be the one waiting…

50:51.506 --> 50:52.758
until you finally miss me.

50:58.597 --> 50:59.431
Okay.

51:01.475 --> 51:03.226
I'll come back to you one day.

51:03.894 --> 51:04.811
Take care of yourself.

51:15.989 --> 51:17.657
[sobs]

51:26.333 --> 51:28.335
[somber music playing]

51:46.353 --> 51:48.146
So, Uk, are you leaving now?

51:48.230 --> 51:49.189
Yes.

51:49.272 --> 51:51.525
Now that the last mage
of Jeongjingak is leaving,

51:51.608 --> 51:55.153
I suppose that place will be
completely empty now.

51:55.237 --> 51:57.030
This just doesn't feel right.

51:57.531 --> 51:59.282
I should go with you, Young Master.

51:59.366 --> 52:00.909
You can't go alone.

52:00.992 --> 52:02.744
But what about me then?

52:04.037 --> 52:06.581
Come on, Maidservant Kim,
my uncle needs you by his side.

52:07.791 --> 52:08.667
[sighs]

52:08.750 --> 52:10.043
Did you meet with her?

52:10.126 --> 52:11.962
[Maid Kim] She didn't offer to go?

52:12.045 --> 52:14.172
I was sure she would insist
on going with you.

52:14.256 --> 52:15.966
She had her reasons not to.

52:17.801 --> 52:20.428
Is Master Lee not here?
I want to say goodbye to him.

52:20.512 --> 52:24.766
Hmm, he had been treating Yul
at Sejukwon for a few days.

52:25.350 --> 52:27.978
But I guess he must have left again.
I don't see him.

52:28.770 --> 52:29.604
Okay, I see.

52:34.901 --> 52:37.863
Should we not, at least,
tell Uk about Naksu?

52:37.946 --> 52:41.449
I wanted to tell him at first too,
but Lady Jin was against it.

52:42.909 --> 52:45.328
Now that I know
Naksu's soul is going to disappear,

52:45.412 --> 52:48.498
it seems that he may be
better off not knowing.

52:49.082 --> 52:49.916
If he knows…

52:52.127 --> 52:53.879
it will be agonizing for both of them.

52:53.962 --> 52:56.256
Jang Uk will agonize over something

52:56.339 --> 52:58.717
much bigger than
simply losing a loved one.

52:59.926 --> 53:01.511
He possesses the power of Hwansu.

53:01.595 --> 53:04.723
If he really wanted to,
he could get rid of Jin Bu-yeon's soul

53:04.806 --> 53:07.100
from the body
in order to keep Naksu's instead.

53:07.183 --> 53:10.103
But that is forbidden,
just like the alchemy of souls.

53:10.937 --> 53:12.480
That's why it's agonizing.

53:13.356 --> 53:16.860
He won't be able to save her
though he has the power to do so.

53:18.236 --> 53:21.489
Jang Uk will struggle with
having to make an impossible decision…

53:24.117 --> 53:25.785
that no ordinary man would make.

53:37.255 --> 53:39.257
[somber music playing]

54:00.487 --> 54:01.947
[sighs]
But…

54:02.530 --> 54:05.784
it looks like Uk and Jin Bu-yeon
are having problems.

54:06.910 --> 54:08.328
Young Lady Jin said

54:08.411 --> 54:10.705
Uk went to see Bu-yeon,
but she refused to see him.

54:11.790 --> 54:14.793
Maybe Uk didn't tell her
about going to the North Fortress?

54:24.094 --> 54:27.305
I see you are a sacred animal
with a rare kind of energy.

54:28.390 --> 54:30.934
A turtle that possesses
the power of the Black Tortoise.

54:32.727 --> 54:35.480
They say the Black Tortoise
guides those who are lost

54:35.563 --> 54:37.148
and leads them in the right direction.

54:46.408 --> 54:48.994
I see you're doing your best
to make your way over

54:49.494 --> 54:51.788
to help someone discover their path.

54:53.289 --> 54:54.374
[chuckles]

54:55.875 --> 54:59.462
Will Cheonbugwan now begin
preparations for the rite of the lake?

55:00.880 --> 55:02.966
Will your secret organization be involved?

55:04.300 --> 55:07.303
I will soon invite Your Highness
to one of our meetings.

55:08.555 --> 55:11.391
You made me a promise that
I would become as powerful as Jang Uk.

55:13.059 --> 55:14.853
Tell me what you need and I'll help you,

55:15.937 --> 55:17.188
whatever it may be.

55:22.861 --> 55:24.195
[man 1] What are those things?

55:24.279 --> 55:26.781
[woman 1] Goodness,
there're so many birds.

55:27.824 --> 55:29.743
- [man 1] What are these? Hm?
- [woman 1] They look very ominous.

55:29.826 --> 55:30.785
[woman 2] Are they birds?

55:31.286 --> 55:32.287
[woman 1] Where do you think
they come from?

55:32.370 --> 55:33.830
[man 2] What are they doing
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

55:33.913 --> 55:35.832
[woman 1] Uh, this is…
this is very, very strange.

55:35.915 --> 55:39.210
They say hundreds of earthenware
have washed up all over the lake.

55:40.712 --> 55:44.924
They must have all been
discarded for the fear of getting caught.

55:45.008 --> 55:48.678
They seem to be earthenware,
but they feel really ominous.

55:48.762 --> 55:51.598
[Jin] Now that something
like this has been found,

55:51.681 --> 55:53.391
it will cause an uproar.

55:54.142 --> 55:56.019
[man 3] No matter
how bad the drought gets,

55:56.102 --> 55:58.063
there is no way the lake will dry.

55:58.146 --> 55:59.564
What are you talking about?

55:59.647 --> 56:04.110
They say the lake once dried up
200 years ago in an awful drought.

56:05.445 --> 56:07.906
- Seriously!
- Ah, shove off!

56:07.989 --> 56:09.157
- What in the world--
- Hey, don't touch it!

56:09.240 --> 56:10.075
[woman 1] Oh, goodness!

56:10.158 --> 56:11.618
[man 2] Why would you touch it?
We don't know what it is.

56:12.202 --> 56:14.329
[man 1] Oh, my gosh.
What are they? What are they?

56:14.412 --> 56:19.292
The capital is in an uproar
because of what I discarded in the lake.

56:20.460 --> 56:22.754
Everyone is worried
that the lake will dry up.

56:22.837 --> 56:24.089
[chuckles]

56:24.881 --> 56:26.174
That's good to hear then.

56:26.883 --> 56:30.845
Having chaos among the people
will cause the Unanimous Assembly

56:30.929 --> 56:33.056
to actively take part
in the rite for the lake.

56:33.640 --> 56:35.850
Songrim will try
to strengthen their guard.

56:35.934 --> 56:39.521
It will be more difficult to bring
earthenware back from the volcano.

56:44.359 --> 56:45.193
[Go Won sighs]

56:45.985 --> 56:47.403
These will be used for the rite.

56:49.364 --> 56:52.826
Bring them along
with the King's gifts from the volcano.

56:53.993 --> 56:57.205
Bringing them that way will prevent
Songrim from doing anything.

56:59.040 --> 57:01.251
We will have to place them
throughout the canals

57:01.334 --> 57:02.335
before the lake's rite.

57:04.087 --> 57:06.881
Would you be able to help with that, Sire?

57:06.965 --> 57:09.717
I'll be sure to inform the men
that stand the Night Watch.

57:10.635 --> 57:12.053
So you may use them.

57:12.137 --> 57:14.472
With the help of the Night Watch,
it will be easy.

57:15.056 --> 57:15.890
[chuckles]

57:18.852 --> 57:21.729
Are these objects
for drying up the world as well?

57:21.813 --> 57:25.233
These were only made to help
the real one when it finally emerges.

57:25.316 --> 57:26.484
The real one…

57:26.985 --> 57:29.362
is the fire bird within Jinyowon.

57:30.321 --> 57:32.198
In order for us to achieve that,

57:32.282 --> 57:34.826
we must control Jinyowon
by moving the Assembly.

57:45.962 --> 57:47.797
I wanted to discuss something

57:47.881 --> 57:50.008
before tomorrow's Unanimous Assembly.

57:50.091 --> 57:52.552
You wish to discuss something with me?

57:52.635 --> 57:54.846
The priestess dancing for the rite

57:55.889 --> 57:57.807
is going to be picked from another family.

57:57.891 --> 57:58.725
What?

57:59.851 --> 58:03.771
The dancer for the lake's rite
has always been a Jinyowon priestess.

58:04.397 --> 58:06.149
You can't possibly pick another family.

58:06.232 --> 58:09.235
No one in Jinyowon possesses the power

58:09.319 --> 58:11.488
necessary to perform
the dance for the rite.

58:11.571 --> 58:13.740
I'm capable, so are my two daughters.

58:13.823 --> 58:14.824
Ho-gyeong.

58:15.950 --> 58:18.411
I'm merely giving you
some advance notice here.

58:18.495 --> 58:21.748
The Unanimous Assembly mages
have already decided on this matter.

58:21.831 --> 58:24.167
If you continue
to feed your ego like this,

58:24.250 --> 58:26.711
you'll only end up embarrassing yourself.

58:27.337 --> 58:28.171
[scoffs]

58:30.006 --> 58:32.926
You are embarrassing yourself

58:33.593 --> 58:35.345
for Jinyowon will not provide you

58:35.428 --> 58:40.308
with any of its artifacts
needed for the rite of the lake.

58:41.267 --> 58:43.728
Everyone agrees with me on this.

58:43.811 --> 58:45.730
Do you truly think you can do that?

58:45.813 --> 58:48.233
Did you forget we possess the plaque

58:48.316 --> 58:51.152
that gives us the power
to reject the King's orders?

58:51.736 --> 58:55.365
[snickers]

59:00.703 --> 59:01.538
[door opens]

59:08.211 --> 59:09.087
Bu-yeon.

59:09.170 --> 59:10.463
It's suffocating in here.

59:11.047 --> 59:13.007
I'm going to meet Young Master Park.

59:13.091 --> 59:14.842
You should also get some air.

59:15.510 --> 59:16.511
Mother isn't home yet.

59:18.846 --> 59:19.764
I am fine, Cho-yeon.

59:19.847 --> 59:20.974
[female mage] Young Lady.

59:21.766 --> 59:23.351
Lady Jin has ordered you to come

59:23.851 --> 59:25.436
with the Jinyowon Plaque right now.

59:25.520 --> 59:26.437
[sighs] Really?

59:28.022 --> 59:29.107
[sighs]

59:31.276 --> 59:32.110
Right now?

59:32.193 --> 59:34.612
She had a heated argument
with Jin Mu, the Gwanju.

59:35.196 --> 59:36.531
You should hurry.

59:38.199 --> 59:40.451
- Did you say Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan?
- Right.

59:44.664 --> 59:46.666
Then I will go instead.

59:46.749 --> 59:47.667
You'll go?

59:49.043 --> 59:50.295
I'm the eldest daughter of our family.

59:50.378 --> 59:51.212
[exclaims]

59:52.171 --> 59:54.966
The Jinyowon Plaque is truly valuable.

59:55.550 --> 59:57.051
If I entrust it to you,

59:57.135 --> 59:58.970
I could get scolded by Mother.

01:00:00.346 --> 01:00:02.098
Are you going to be the heir of Jinyowon?

01:00:03.182 --> 01:00:06.144
Then you'll have to
marry a man who will move in.

01:00:06.227 --> 01:00:07.812
And I don't think
Park Dang-gu would do that.

01:00:08.479 --> 01:00:09.355
[sighs]

01:00:11.566 --> 01:00:12.400
I will go.

01:00:13.693 --> 01:00:14.527
Okay.

01:00:15.361 --> 01:00:16.362
[Cho-yeon] Then you go.

01:00:19.198 --> 01:00:21.159
[dramatic music playing]

01:00:27.290 --> 01:00:28.833
[Bu-yeon]
Among the memories I've recovered,

01:00:29.876 --> 01:00:31.169
Jin Mu is there as well.

01:00:37.925 --> 01:00:38.926
[bell ringing]

01:00:43.931 --> 01:00:45.433
The one who made me an assassin,

01:00:46.184 --> 01:00:48.645
used me, and killed me.

01:00:50.355 --> 01:00:51.189
And now,

01:00:52.023 --> 01:00:53.024
I am meeting him.

01:00:55.401 --> 01:00:57.445
[Ho-gyeong]
The Jinyowon Plaque will arrive soon.

01:00:57.528 --> 01:01:00.907
Even that Jinyowon Plaque will
also be taken away tomorrow

01:01:00.990 --> 01:01:02.158
by the Unanimous Assembly.

01:01:02.241 --> 01:01:03.242
You can't do that.

01:01:03.326 --> 01:01:05.078
You could put your precious Jinyowon

01:01:05.161 --> 01:01:07.705
in grave danger
because of personal reasons.

01:01:08.289 --> 01:01:12.710
He said that it's something
that cannot be overlooked.

01:01:12.794 --> 01:01:14.796
- Who in the world--
- [Go Won] I gave the order.

01:01:22.512 --> 01:01:24.514
[suspenseful music playing]

01:01:28.726 --> 01:01:31.604
You made a promise with Songrim
and allowed all of them

01:01:32.188 --> 01:01:34.482
to disturb the fire bird's barrier
inside Jinyowon.

01:01:35.692 --> 01:01:37.485
I was there and I saw it happen.

01:01:38.194 --> 01:01:41.698
But that was a matter
you helped with, Your Royal Highness.

01:01:43.241 --> 01:01:45.702
But in the end, you still allowed them
to meddle with the barrier.

01:01:45.785 --> 01:01:47.954
And since a spell was used in Jinyowon,

01:01:48.037 --> 01:01:50.957
it could very well have awakened
all the artifacts there.

01:01:51.833 --> 01:01:52.750
This is why…

01:01:53.668 --> 01:01:56.212
I stood outside Jinyowon
to prevent exactly that.

01:01:56.838 --> 01:01:59.465
I used my divine powers
in order to keep everything safe.

01:02:00.508 --> 01:02:01.342
Ho-gyeong.

01:02:02.260 --> 01:02:04.345
Your hair has started
to gray around your ears.

01:02:05.680 --> 01:02:08.182
[Jin Mu] Your powers are not
as strong as they were.

01:02:09.058 --> 01:02:11.644
That's the main reason
we are withdrawing the plaque from you.

01:02:30.329 --> 01:02:31.622
What are you doing over here?

01:02:35.084 --> 01:02:36.127
Were you kicked out?

01:02:40.631 --> 01:02:43.426
Since the plaque's on its way,
you can go ahead and leave it.

01:02:44.010 --> 01:02:46.429
As your brother, I do not wish

01:02:46.512 --> 01:02:49.807
to see you embarrass yourself
in front of everyone here.

01:02:50.558 --> 01:02:53.269
All you've done is
show your already weakened powers,

01:02:53.770 --> 01:02:55.146
so just give up the plaque.

01:02:55.229 --> 01:02:56.606
[Ho-gyeong breathes shakily]

01:03:05.406 --> 01:03:07.158
Jin Bu-yeon from Jinyowon is here.

01:03:08.743 --> 01:03:10.745
[dramatic music playing]

01:03:14.874 --> 01:03:15.875
Bu-yeon, why are you here?

01:03:23.674 --> 01:03:26.135
I'm the eldest daughter of the Jin family.

01:03:26.219 --> 01:03:27.345
My name is Jin Bu-yeon.

01:03:27.428 --> 01:03:29.972
Jin Cho-yeon couldn't make it,
but Jin Bu-yeon is here.

01:03:30.932 --> 01:03:34.393
Mother, I brought the plaque
that you were asking for.

01:03:50.326 --> 01:03:51.619
[Jin Mu] Thank you for your trouble.

01:03:52.370 --> 01:03:55.164
Now please leave the plaque
and be on your way.

01:03:55.873 --> 01:03:57.333
Why do we have to leave it here though?

01:03:58.417 --> 01:04:00.503
It is the Jin family's most valuable item.

01:04:00.586 --> 01:04:03.172
Your mother has admitted the fact that

01:04:04.006 --> 01:04:06.425
no one in your family can protect it.

01:04:08.219 --> 01:04:09.053
Ho-gyeong.

01:04:09.136 --> 01:04:11.097
Please put down the plaque right now.

01:04:15.017 --> 01:04:16.519
My duty as the leader

01:04:17.186 --> 01:04:19.063
is to protect this plaque with my life.

01:04:20.273 --> 01:04:23.276
What must I do to change your mind?

01:04:23.359 --> 01:04:25.987
I do not remember
standing upright like that…

01:04:27.363 --> 01:04:30.116
the last time I came
to beg for my life. Do you?

01:04:32.660 --> 01:04:33.578
[sighs]

01:04:38.541 --> 01:04:41.544
[inhales deeply]

01:04:50.928 --> 01:04:52.930
What if I can prove my abilities to you?

01:04:53.890 --> 01:04:55.892
[suspenseful music playing]

01:04:58.603 --> 01:05:00.313
I'm the heir of Jinyowon.

01:05:01.230 --> 01:05:03.858
I'll show you that
I'm more than capable of keeping it safe.

01:05:05.151 --> 01:05:07.153
I heard you lost
your memory due to illness.

01:05:08.029 --> 01:05:10.448
Does that mean you've also lost

01:05:10.948 --> 01:05:13.200
Jin Seol-ran's divine powers?

01:05:14.201 --> 01:05:16.078
Well then, isn't that a pity for us?

01:05:17.038 --> 01:05:20.458
Both my memories and powers
have started to return.

01:05:21.083 --> 01:05:23.294
Really? Then please allow me to

01:05:23.794 --> 01:05:27.214
test your extraordinary powers.

01:05:27.298 --> 01:05:28.549
Fine. Very well.

01:05:29.800 --> 01:05:31.677
So what do you want me to do to prove it?

01:05:39.101 --> 01:05:43.064
This is the prison of Cheonbugwan
that holds those who performed sorcery.

01:05:43.940 --> 01:05:47.401
Behind that door is
a dark prison called Gwido.

01:05:47.485 --> 01:05:50.780
This very door was created
by the great Jin Seol-ran,

01:05:51.656 --> 01:05:53.115
the first leader of Jinyowon,

01:05:53.199 --> 01:05:54.867
so I'm sure you know it well.

01:05:56.911 --> 01:06:00.873
It's a prison that, so far,
not even a ghost has escaped from.

01:06:00.957 --> 01:06:02.208
What exactly are you doing?

01:06:02.792 --> 01:06:05.002
You mean to say
you'll send Bu-yeon in there?

01:06:05.670 --> 01:06:07.880
I do not mean I will lock her up in there.

01:06:08.506 --> 01:06:10.508
They say Jin Bu-yeon even managed

01:06:10.591 --> 01:06:14.011
to find the ice stone
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:06:14.595 --> 01:06:15.429
[gasps]

01:06:16.555 --> 01:06:19.016
So I will throw the plaque inside Gwido.

01:06:19.892 --> 01:06:22.895
If she can bring back
the Jinyowon Plaque in a day…

01:06:26.482 --> 01:06:28.609
then I shall acknowledge
your divine powers

01:06:28.693 --> 01:06:30.903
and cancel tomorrow's Unanimous Assembly.

01:06:36.158 --> 01:06:37.118
I will go in there.

01:06:38.035 --> 01:06:38.995
[Ho-gyeong] You cannot.

01:06:39.078 --> 01:06:41.497
The wraiths of those
who performed sorcery remain.

01:06:41.998 --> 01:06:43.666
Any of those wraiths could
easily kill you.

01:06:43.749 --> 01:06:45.501
Then you'll let them take
Jinyowon like this?

01:06:54.635 --> 01:06:56.512
Have faith in your daughter's powers.

01:06:57.263 --> 01:06:58.097
[gasps]

01:06:59.515 --> 01:07:00.558
You shouldn't worry.

01:07:01.809 --> 01:07:03.060
I'll find it and return.

01:07:08.858 --> 01:07:11.110
Putting the plaque inside
is too dangerous.

01:07:11.193 --> 01:07:14.405
I heard a mage from the Choi family
also died in there 200 years ago.

01:07:14.488 --> 01:07:18.784
What if a priestess
of Jinyowon would also die in there?

01:07:21.245 --> 01:07:23.664
That kind of thought
is a sign of weakness.

01:07:30.671 --> 01:07:32.673
[ominous music playing]

01:08:13.756 --> 01:08:16.133
You have until sundown to find the plaque.

01:08:19.512 --> 01:08:20.679
But what do you have there?

01:08:25.518 --> 01:08:26.894
I found it coming here.

01:08:32.233 --> 01:08:35.444
It's an animal with good energy,
so I'd like to take it with me.

01:08:37.780 --> 01:08:38.614
Go ahead.

01:08:46.288 --> 01:08:48.290
[dramatic music playing]

01:09:13.315 --> 01:09:14.275
[exclaims softly]

01:09:23.659 --> 01:09:24.910
He said it's a prison.

01:09:26.203 --> 01:09:27.788
But why is it so big?

01:09:28.873 --> 01:09:30.958
How am I supposed to find
that small plaque here?

01:09:33.878 --> 01:09:35.796
What if it fell into the sea over there?

01:09:39.592 --> 01:09:40.676
[sighs]

01:09:50.811 --> 01:09:52.354
[spooky howling]

01:09:53.230 --> 01:09:55.524
[eerie music playing]

01:10:05.451 --> 01:10:06.911
[wraiths whooshing]

01:10:49.620 --> 01:10:50.704
[grunts]

01:11:05.552 --> 01:11:06.470
[gasps]

01:11:15.145 --> 01:11:17.147
[tense music playing]

01:11:34.581 --> 01:11:36.166
[tense music intensifying]

01:11:47.303 --> 01:11:48.762
[shrieking]

01:11:55.602 --> 01:11:57.229
[growls]

01:11:57.313 --> 01:11:58.522
[panting in fear]

01:12:01.025 --> 01:12:03.068
[suspenseful music playing]

01:12:07.489 --> 01:12:08.324
[grunts]

01:12:10.451 --> 01:12:12.494
[howling]

01:12:17.166 --> 01:12:19.084
[roaring]

01:12:19.168 --> 01:12:20.878
[panting in fear]

01:12:29.011 --> 01:12:30.262
[Jang Uk] You're okay?

01:12:37.978 --> 01:12:38.812
Jang Uk?

01:12:38.896 --> 01:12:40.147
What are you doing here?

01:12:42.816 --> 01:12:44.151
How did you get here?

01:12:44.985 --> 01:12:45.903
More importantly…

01:12:48.155 --> 01:12:48.989
what is that?

01:12:51.116 --> 01:12:51.950
What?

01:12:54.495 --> 01:12:55.788
That thing in your eyes.

01:13:00.167 --> 01:13:01.001
Who…

01:13:03.253 --> 01:13:04.088
are you?

01:13:08.092 --> 01:13:10.094
[intense music playing]

01:13:22.272 --> 01:13:24.274
["I'm Sorry" by Ailee playing]

01:13:36.829 --> 01:13:39.790
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:13:39.873 --> 01:13:42.042
Only I'm allowed to be this close.

01:13:42.126 --> 01:13:44.920
Did you perhaps hear
the sound of bells during that time?

01:13:45.587 --> 01:13:48.715
[Jin Mu] It will be a world
where the strong gain greater power

01:13:48.799 --> 01:13:52.010
and we'll continue
to hold that power forever!

01:13:52.511 --> 01:13:54.430
[Bu-yeon] You'll have to
eradicate them all to end this.

01:13:54.513 --> 01:13:57.683
Because I, too, will likely
disappear in this place.

01:13:57.766 --> 01:13:59.560
[Jin] The world
that they've been hoping for

01:13:59.643 --> 01:14:01.562
will never get the chance to exist.

01:14:01.645 --> 01:14:03.522
[Jang Uk] Is this not the kind of world
you so desperately wanted?

01:14:03.605 --> 01:14:05.732
Get a clear look of what it is like

01:14:05.816 --> 01:14:09.486
for someone with immense strength
to gain and wield even greater power.
